.env
.env.local

# Raw captured upstream responses (privacy + size) — never commit
data/_raw/

# Ingest virtualenv
scripts/ingest_land_data/.venv/

# ===== ↑ 以上同步自 .gitignore（「从 .gitignore 同步」只重写以上部分）=====
.git/
.hg/
.svn/
node_modules/
bower_components/
jspm_packages/
__pycache__/
site-packages/
venv/
coverage/
htmlcov/
lcov-report/
cmakefiles/
cmake-build-*/
bazel-*/
pods/
deriveddata/
storybook-static/
playwright-report/
test-results/
allure-results/
allure-report/
cdk.out/
*.egg-info/
*.dist-info/
eggs/
pip-wheel-metadata/
wheels/
# ----- ↑ 以上为 ZCode 默认排除规则（自定义规则请写在本行下方，不会被同步/恢复改动）-----
# 自定义规则写在下方（本行提示可删除）
# AI tools must never see secrets or databases (see docs/AI_RULES.md; same list as .aiderignore)
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite3-*
*.db
*.pem
*.key
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*
backups/
**/*.dump
